            "review_text": "Compass18303415692\n7 contributions\n0\nExecutive Enjoyment\nAug 2025 • Family\nI enjoyed the executive lounge at Hilton Da Nang.\nFrom 17:30, there was also alcohol, which was said to be a light meal, but there were also fried rice, yakisoba noodles, sandwiches and other filling dishes, which were very satisfying.\nI'm tired of sightseeing, so I'm going to go home and stop by.\nI felt really good because I was hungry, I could relax, the view was good, and the staff were always smiling.\nI wanted to come again.\nJosie's service was great 😀\nRead more\nValue\nRooms\nLocation\nCleanliness\nService\nSleep Quality\nTranslated from Japanese\nShow original\nWritten August 22, 2025",
